    {
      "q": "Where can I find the Eastgardens Service Centre?",
      "a": "The Eastgardens Service Centre is located within a shopping centre and offers on-site parking.",
      "link": null
    },
    {
      "q": "Is the Eastgardens Service Centre accessible?",
      "a": "Yes, the centre offers wheelchair access, quiet hours, and public toilets are less than 50m away.",
      "link": null
    },
    {
      "q": "How do I book a driving test at the Eastgardens Service Centre?",
      "a": "Driver testing is offered by appointment. For parking, use the Wentworth Avenue entrance and proceed up ramp to Level 2 Red Car Park. Park in the allocated driving test area near Myer entrance.",
      "link": null
    },
    {
      "q": "What are the nearest Service NSW centres to Eastgardens?",
      "a": "The nearest locations include the Botany Service Centre, Bondi Junction Service Centre, and Marrickville Service Centre.",
